{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "64c3e4fc95cc2ed7fbf18db4d22e44312d04b692e88a3141662b251a365393a9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\n教育実習生の姫、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了唷。\n扮成实习老师的公主，看起来如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
