{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "af84c5008f0427f2c4aa2dbbca8925405a5fa74ef1b55da670331e6e6fe4249f", "ja": "え、{$P$}Pくん？\n授業って……ここで？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}P同学？\n你说上课……在这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "40e8b708825a856339ca808f31c7867386043dce6fa8280ebc8021591104445e", "ja": "そうなのです！　もうお仕事は終わったので、\n問題なっしんぐ！なのです。", "zh": "没错的喔！\n工作已经结束了，所以没问题的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1007_p", "source_sha256": "85916aa44d66cde8a316c895ab53bbb49ad87da12d4a32edfeeaea1c458e3ccc", "ja": "確かに、撮影の終了予定時間まで1時間はあるから、\n大丈夫ではあるけど。でも、まつり……。", "zh": "距离拍摄预计结束的时间还有一小时，\n确实是没问题啦。不过，茉莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "9d02ce490f5c013eed05b8e36cf865203aab0fa8306275b5f14ebd619d3e4f87", "ja": "ストップ！　まつり、ではないのですよ？\n今のまつりは、まつりでも姫でもないのです。", "zh": "停！不是茉莉的唷。\n现在的茉莉，不是茉莉也不是公主的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "32293002a979512a7e593ac0b06a8370678ca5639736eeb81c702b87712ec324", "ja": "わんだほー！でびゅーりほー！な、\nまつり姫先生なのですー！", "zh": "是美妙又美丽的茉莉公主老师的喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "68a3ee91d3b4b03e81f0b6f8dcc7c6b7829e5b124a60e3920ecdff5a64fc9ec7", "ja": "先生か……それなら、まつり姫先生より\n徳川先生って呼んだ方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "老师吗……那与其叫茉莉公主老师，\n不如叫德川老师比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "87b260d8d76fd022d96df1ffa38199e168f9e79aa3628f21b2f4040c1890e014", "ja": "ま・つ・り・ひ・め、先生なのです♪", "zh": "茉、莉、公、主、老师的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0133_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "ed59a5a6a54d0b1ab46970a35057fc6d15fe0cb7468df1a259a54f873eafdc32", "ja": "びしばし！授業をするので、\n{$P$}くん、席につくのです。", "zh": "老师会严厉教课的，\n{$P$}同学，坐到位子上的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
